  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"472a4490-bf9d-4ad8-a14e-94f018f4b589"],

Cell["\<\
A key is read with curried access, as on any of this paclet's objects.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8f39ad02-5210-42d8-b4a1-12caf7e298fb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The quotient map is a quasi-isomorphism exactly when the model is of Hodge \
type, which ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HodgeTypeQ"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HodgeTypeQ", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "942c55d7-7d37-46f9-a2b1-5c578de93ce4"],
 " decides; on a model that is not, the algebra is still built and is still a \
Poincare duality algebra, but it no longer carries the model's homotopy \
type."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"07360109-3820-40ab-ac99-9855a4c020a0"],

Cell["\<\
The algebra displays as a summary box: its basis and its degree, with the \
degrees, the Gram matrix, the differential and the model under the opener.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"fca408d8-a5e0-460e-bc2b-1d9e91226a8d"]
}, Open  ]],

